/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066900/extras/6189d32c872b6256ed7ea187a6bf0a45.webm?t=1768407096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your hull</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct your vehicle plate by plate. Armor interacts with projectiles in realistic ways, with penetration based on kinetic energy. Set plate thickness, adjust angles and watch how shots deflect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066900/extras/5bbcdcb19cb5d7ecbdd55c87688ce333.poster.avif?t=1768407096\" width=1024 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066900/extras/5bbcdcb19cb5d7ecbdd55c87688ce333.webm?t=1768407096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066900/extras/5bbcdcb19cb5d7ecbdd55c87688ce333.mp4?t=1768407096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Test it out</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive, optimize your creations, and fight against other vehicles across diverse scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066900/extras/c0d16f3354a7b98b5406ff32d133decd.poster.avif?t=1768407096\" width=1024 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066900/extras/c0d16f3354a7b98b5406ff32d133decd.webm?t=1768407096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066900/extras/c0d16f3354a7b98b5406ff32d133decd.mp4?t=1768407096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Ale\u0161 Gajdacz"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.ak